{"game": "aliens-fireteam-elite", "language": "english", "appid": 1549970, "month": "2024-07", "window": 2, "start_date": 1720396800, "end_date": 1721087999, "month_true_total": 100, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-04 02:23:43 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "169945474", "author": {"steamid": "76561199232626246", "personaname": "So TikTok is wifi", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/SoTikTokIsWifi/", "num_games_owned": 105, "num_reviews": 57, "playtime_forever": 833, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 778, "last_played": 1723644910, "avatar": "d82a9dc2d9029d930a0af80e9af46676dd2ab401"}, "language": "english", "review": "I do say, after almost completing the entire game, it is a solid game.\r\nRating of graphics 7.8/10\r\nRating of story-line and plot 8/10\r\nDifficulty of the levels 6/10\r\nLevel design 10/10\r\n", "timestamp_created": 1721068984, "timestamp_updated": 1721068984, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "169916518", "author": {"steamid": "76561198168423746", "personaname": "iwaniljan", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198168423746/", "num_games_owned": 149, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 6788, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1140, "last_played": 1737142071, "avatar": "933fffa8f3b690f5d6ff457805e9ca7db347fde5"}, "language": "english", "review": "11/10", "timestamp_created": 1721038380, "timestamp_updated": 1721038380, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "169908191", "author": {"steamid": "76561198159866631", "personaname": "Kingdarkknight13", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/darknicxking13/", "num_games_owned": 210, "num_reviews": 41, "playtime_forever": 1360, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 669, "last_played": 1722115071, "avatar": "83d2ab083eb76aebed718fd01921fbe2af2b7e35"}, "language": "english", "review": "got it on a steep discount. \r\n\r\ngame play is amazing, and so far the story is not bad.", "timestamp_created": 1721026453, "timestamp_updated": 1721026453, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "169889174", "author": {"steamid": "76561198312469295", "personaname": "Bearsnacckk", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198312469295/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 655, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 655, "last_played": 1721771535, "avatar": "5e9cef2170a51e97a5a4b08b7b927cdff8c3b1bb"}, "language": "english", "review": "A fun Aliens game. Fun to play with friends.\n\nA solid buy, especially if on sale.", "timestamp_created": 1720999781, "timestamp_updated": 1720999781, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.472222238779067993", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "169885487", "author": {"steamid": "76561197966210954", "personaname": "Chigger", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/commandersigma/", "num_games_owned": 445, "num_reviews": 240, "playtime_forever": 1032, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1032, "last_played": 1720949651, "avatar": "1c4680772378215fdc47a9c175d1a933f862e8d0"}, "language": "english", "review": "6.5/10 (7.5-8 with a group of friends) - 10 points for doing the pulse rifle and smartgun dirty.\r\nWhile the solo play isn't as bad as people make it out to be, it isn't great. And while there are mods to make the friendly bots better, its still meant for playing with other people. Too bad online is dead and getting friends to play isn't easy. \r\nThe game is pretty much left4dead and gears of war blended together then painted with aliens. Core Gameplay is fun, though it can get really repetitive. The challenge cards can make things interesting, and honestly the only replay value it has. \r\nthe visuals are fairly good and it runs well. The sound on the other hand.. voice acting isn't good and the weapon sounds are all muffled.\r\nThen there's the story. Oh boy.. I could be wrong about this, but it feels like they took most of the story beats and lore from the books and table tops... which the majority of players aren't going to be familiar with. So those like me that just watch the movies and play the games, its going to be nonsensical. Even worse, they lean heavily into the two prequel movies, which are mediocre retcon messes. The story makes ACM's story look good.\r\nGame is also kinda scummy with the dlc, but the only one you actually should pick up is the extra campaign chapter. Either way, its somewhat fun and worth playing, but get it on a deep sale. Especially if you can't rope in two other friends.", "timestamp_created": 1720995280, "timestamp_updated": 1720995280, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}]}